<h3><u>Azadari na chhodenge</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>labbaik ya hussain<br />
labbaik</p>

<p>azaa ka dushman hai gar zamaana to ham hussaini hain yaad rakhna<br />
sada rahegi sadaa e maatam bahega sailaab aansuwon ka<br />
mitaa na paayegi ham ko dunya hai saath apne dua e zehra</p>

<p>labbaik</p>

<p>dua e fatema hai girya o zaari na chorenge<br />
ham apni jaan de denge azaadaari na chorenge</p>

<p>na hoti gar dua e fatema phir ham kahaan hote<br />
agar ye gham nahi hota to ehle gham kahaan hote<br />
janaabe sayyada ki farmabardaari na chorenge</p>

<p>ham apni jaan de denge azaadaari na chorenge</p>

<p>kabhi bhi kaarwaane nusrate sheh ruk nahi sakta<br />
hamaara sar kate kat jaaye lekin jhuk nahi sakta<br />
ali ke maan ne waale hain khud daari na chorenge</p>

<p>ham apni jaan de denge azaadaari na chorenge</p>

<p>zamaane ko sabak sikh laagaye karbobala waale<br />
sitamgar ki himaayat kar nahi sakte khuda waale<br />
kisi mazlum o bekas ki tarafdaari na chorenge</p>

<p>ham apni jaan de denge azaadaari na chorenge</p>

<p>khuda ka din baaqi mustafa ki shaan baaqi hai<br />
hussaini majlison se jazba e imaan baaqi hai<br />
rakhenge masjidein aabaad dindaari na chorenge</p>

<p>ham apni jaan de denge azaadaari na chorenge</p>

<p>bataayenge sabhi ko daastaan pyaas aur paani ki<br />
sabeele aab hogi yaad me ashnadahaani ki<br />
ali asghar tumhaari naaz bardaari na chorenge</p>

<p>ham apni jaan de denge azaadaari na chorenge</p>

<p>labe shabbir pe soya paher ki pyaas ke sadqe<br />
hame sab kuch mila hai parchame abbas ke sadqe<br />
khuda ne haath bakhshe hain alamdaari na chorenge</p>

<p>ham apni jaan de denge azaadaari na chorenge</p>

<p>ek aysa bewatan jiska janaaza bhi nahi uttha<br />
wo arze karbala aur bekafan shabbir ka laasha<br />
qasam khaate hain hargiz taazya daari na chorenge</p>

<p>ham apni jaan de denge azaadaari na chorenge</p>

<p>ham ek din maqsade karbobala sab ko bataa denge<br />
hussaini hain yazidiyat ko dunya se mita denge<br />
kabhi islaam ke dushman se bezaari na chorenge</p>

<p>ham apni jaan de denge azaadaari na chorenge</p>

<p>sada mesum ke hothon par rahe shabbir ka nauha<br />
kalim hoti rahe is tarha tiskeene dile zehra<br />
bapa maatam rakhenge girya o zaari na chorenge</p>

<p>ham apni jaan de denge azaadaari na chorenge<br />
labbaik</p>
